WEBVTT

00:03.480 --> 00:09.500
Strike hard! Quench it immediately! Put your backs into it, boys!

00:15.800 --> 00:23.000
Your Highness, take a look: fifty thousand blades and thirty thousand spears—all forged from the finest refined steel!

00:23.200 --> 00:29.500
These weapons were tempered to cleave straight through the heavy scale mail of the northern barbarians!

00:29.800 --> 00:36.500
Well done, Yuanzhi. With weapons of such craftsmanship, our warriors on the northern expedition will fight with double the confidence!

00:37.000 --> 00:44.000
When I was a lad wandering the northern steppes with my father, our tribe had no fine iron—we could only sharpen scrap hoes into daggers.

00:44.200 --> 00:53.000
Today, watching mountains of gleaming steel rise under our hammers... this is the proudest work of my life!

00:53.500 --> 01:00.000
Test one for me. Let us witness just how sharp these blades truly are!
